        {
          "text": "(Nkaambo Ogi mwami wa-Basana nguwakasyaala alike akati kaba-Refai. Bulo bwakwe bwakali bulo bwabutale, Sa tabuboneki ku-Raba kucisi cabana ba-Amoni? Bulamfu bwabo bwakali tukokola tuli musanu atune, abwaamba bwabo bwakali tukokola tone, nkokuti cakupima akakokola kamuntu).",
          "type": "text",
