        },
        {
          "text": "Njeeyo nyika njitwakatola kuciindi eco, nkabela ndakapa ba-Rubeni aba-Gadi nyika yoonse kuzwa ku-Aroeri kunkomwe yakalonga ka-Arinoni, acisela cacilundu ca-Gileadi aminzi yaco. ",
