        },
        {
          "text": "Acimwi cisela ca-Gileadi, acisi coonse ca-Ogi caku-Basana, nkokuti cisi coonse ca-Arigobi, ndakacipa cisela camusyobo wa-Manase. (Cisi eco ca-Basana cilaambwa kuti ncecisi cabaRefai. ",
