        {
          "text": "Jairi mwana wa-Manase nguwakatola cisi coonse ca-Arigobi, nkokuti Basana, kusikila kumugaano waba-Gesuri awaba-Maakari, aboobo cisi cakaulikwa izina lya-Havoti-Jairi, mbocicaambwa asunu.) ",
