        },
        {
          "text": "Aba-Rubeni aba-Gadi, ndakabapa nyika kuzwa ku-Gileadi kusikila kukalonga ka-Arinoni, (Mugaano wakali akatikati kakalonga), akusikila kukalonga ka-Jaboki, mugaano wabana ba-Amoni, ",
