        {
          "text": "ayalo nyika ya-Araba, kusikila kumugaano waku-Jordano, kuzwa ku-Kineroti kusikila kulwizi lwaku-Araba, lwizi lwamunyo, kunsi lyaminkuni ya-Pisiga kujwe.",
