        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kuciindi eco ndakamulailila kuti, Jehova Leza wanu wamupa nyika eyi kuti mwiivube. Lino muleelede kuzubuka azilwisyo zyanu kunembo lyabana bakwanu bana ba-Israyeli, nkokuti boonse baalumi basilumamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
