          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele Jehova wakandikalalila nkaambo kandinywe, aboobo takwakandiswiilila. Jehova wakandaambila kuti, Uleke kwaamba, Utandaambili limbi aya makani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanta amutwe wacilundu ca-Pisiga, ukatambye meso aako kumbo akunyika akumusanza akujwe, ukaibone ameso aako, nkaambo tokooyoozubuka oyu mulonga wa-Jordano pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
